    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b68bde1e3c13e104272120",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙露出了浅浅的笑意，这已经足以表达她的想法：\r\n“我接受『你』”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ef034b6e9c8bad21d595d65fe74106f9a3ff1bde4cfd2044c4550c1ed705df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
