      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谁知道呢……\r\n不过……新宇宙倒是比想象中要老实得多呀。\r\n对她的印象也开始改变了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bc992ed34bf6b5b84e535f95f2f547ca5ac6c2be1a42c7fc78daf1506df746",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
