    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82a46647d20e6daa045b4244",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她喃喃着，无法从语调来判断她究竟是在询问我还是在自言\r\n自语。不过既然她的视线一直停留在我身上，那我也应该作出回答才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5110a9f7fd8ac6f350675c2c6dae89662239a2a25674a74599aaab4e3d94ec8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
