    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e85e3faba3b7f109aa12e04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……无法“观测”。“Dark matter”……\r\n『真相不明』，无法确定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585a777836862a94f137cbe1d18deedbf1f347ce0b52000831bb2a1f493cddee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4ec94d80c287c14ff13a805",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她的意思是……\r\n她也不太了解我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "752274102fdc4fb05061eb982f93512f504a13d0370a60278ecfd2f503f03860",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b23e3f2d2dc6da9e8bb5e71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当我侧头思考问题时，\r\n新宇宙也如我一般轻轻歪起头来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d4e254b51b5372cc13453ffbd7c05469655ce18d7a8b626fa27b9730dec7eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4206d7082f854a7b87ca0493",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自从我成为新宇宙的签约训练员以来，\r\n已经过了相当一段时间。\r\n虽然训练一直都在顺利进行，没遇到过什么问题……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa11571c36c3f02db5fcbf8ff9ed89a9a5763503fce923edd72fd50afceb949",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c3feeeb69297dcb5e30ac2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，说起来……确实啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f51ba95c8b2e9cd963bc7c0a9b3588c3adf3e2a5040a7f56f3e67904ce873e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb43c7e2b5aaeec98fbf1bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的确不太了解新宇宙……\r\n与此同时，我似乎也没给她机会让她了解我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d895912857c0840916633a98a315dffe50f8f95f0865832a557ef94b627cef84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
