    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0ac450eb41e5d04ea503f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论什么事情都好——",
      "source_fingerprint": "41d171ef9cee692103c64d5c3135fcf3cfd9dfaabbee9f64754bc5beaae3bbef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51128624ca461a2671e9eacd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙紧盯着我，那眼神仿佛是在寻找着什么。\r\n我则迎着她的视线，努力表达着我渴望互相理解的心愿。\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf7970860b5ead10bdd8ed3be04c4d2e0da194fe8eb88f268ba10675108a2c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ed1f3800773f162de1f64f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管是训练的烦恼还是别的事情，哪怕只是不着边际的闲聊……\r\n总之，希望她能够多多与我交流才好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9758d92ed39f907c0215b2180a1c450812098ef8b06b171ef21518c9ebbacf34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8b467812a773d1f5b99d2e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要她希望的话——我会用尽全力去理解她话语的含义，\r\n去回答她的问题。\r\n要达成相互理解——最简单的方式当然是交流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e5561c7c9360a3093c76dd4ca83dfdff82f317be043c131eb019014d653127",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
